# Force LF regardless of a contributor's local core.autocrlf. Without
# this, a fresh clone on Windows with the common core.autocrlf=true
# checks every .go file out with CRLF line endings, and `gofmt -l .`
# reports every single file as needing reformatting -- not because the
# code is wrong, but purely from the line-ending conversion. Found by
# actually cloning this repo fresh and running the commands in
# CONTRIBUTING.md, per the Phase 11 gate.
* text=auto eol=lf
